  m_Name: Aground - getting her off
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.VisualScripting.Flow::Unity.VisualScripting.ScriptGraphAsset
  _data:
    _json: '{"graph":{"variables":{"Kind":"Flow","collection":{"$content":[],"$version":"A"},"$version":"A"},"controlInputDefinitions":[],"controlOutputDefinitions":[],"valueInputDefinitions":[],"valueOutputDefinitions":[],"title":"Aground - getting her off","summary":"She''s stuck fast on her course and the crew''s own try at the oars hasn''t freed her (Code/Game/Voyage/Aground.cs). The clock stops while you choose: wait for the tide (only where a tide will float her soon enough; time runs fast till it does), row her off, over the side and push her to water deep enough, or leave her for now. The numbers are in voyage_rules.json (''aground''); your writing goes in writing.json under each key.","pan":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0},"zoom":1.0,"elements":[{"coroutine":true,"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"44f76ac2-1089-4d62-96bc-4140b1825cfd","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.OnAground","$id":"9"},{"defaultValues":{"key":{"$content":"aground","$type":"System.String"},"title":{"$content":"Aground","$type":"System.String"},"intention":{"$content":"","$type":"System.String"},"frost":{"$content":false,"$type":"System.Boolean"}},"position":{"x":260.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"a87caeff-da16-42b6-9157-6ec7270e2a64","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.TextShow","$id":"11"},{"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":500.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"795428a5-2281-45a2-b1c4-2cb4780421b4","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.AgroundAddOptions","$id":"13"},{"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":720.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"62908231-93d9-4036-af33-049170c9ea30","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.TextWaitForChoice","$id":"15"},{"defaultValues":{"choice":{"$content":0,"$type":"System.Int32"}},"position":{"x":960.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"2dd326bc-9418-4045-8182-3e7da98819a4","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.AgroundChoose","$id":"17"},{"defaultValues":{"key":{"$content":"aground.outcome","$type":"System.String"},"title":{"$content":"Aground","$type":"System.String"},"intention":{"$content":"","$type":"System.String"},"frost":{"$content":false,"$type":"System.Boolean"}},"position":{"x":1200.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"a309460d-47b4-4981-a05c-38470ea6cb04","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.TextShow","$id":"19"},{"defaultValues":{"key":{"$content":"aground.go_on","$type":"System.String"},"intention":{"$content":"Go on","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":1440.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"8121d560-a1fb-4895-a74e-055907a1b0ed","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.TextAddOption","$id":"21"},{"defaultValues":{"seconds":{"$content":8.0,"$type":"System.Single"},"fallback":{"$content":0,"$type":"System.Int32"}},"position":{"x":1680.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"41f3da18-0d40-42f0-a594-7bf01c1d268b","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.TextWaitForChoiceTimed","$id":"23"},{"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":1920.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"63b663e0-74db-4216-a1cb-77007bf61c07","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.TextHide","$id":"25"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"9"},"sourceKey":"trigger","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"11"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"ce7e27c7-74a1-41eb-92d1-b43463811bde","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"11"},"sourceKey":"exit","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"13"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"251a71a2-41a1-435e-9f68-cf07d97478b5","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"13"},"sourceKey":"exit","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"15"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"e4d6f088-c2c9-40ac-9853-006deb97c075","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"15"},"sourceKey":"exit","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"17"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"144015e8-af51-4e1f-8299-3fa876905803","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"17"},"sourceKey":"exit","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"19"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"4ef0621c-386c-456a-a6c6-cf617bcd4f00","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"19"},"sourceKey":"exit","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"21"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"c4c7872a-b67a-4e56-95e4-5ef7af036ce6","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"21"},"sourceKey":"exit","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"23"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"a7c638bc-6e99-4deb-a8ff-0d613efd3b67","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"23"},"sourceKey":"exit","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"25"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"da8bedf9-39ea-46a5-b77d-f41afc3d525c","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"9"},"sourceKey":"facts","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"11"},"destinationKey":"intention","guid":"3ec60bb0-9a36-481e-8302-5c9e91816835","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"15"},"sourceKey":"choice","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"17"},"destinationKey":"choice","guid":"b1948341-9272-4d48-8463-ee165a9d172e","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"17"},"sourceKey":"outcome","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"19"},"destinationKey":"intention","guid":"ebee75ae-4e41-46e5-abf4-e33fdcfbf54a","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"position":{"xMin":-40.0,"yMin":-60.0,"xMax":2560.0,"yMax":360.0},"label":"1. Stuck fast","comment":"On aground -> how she lies (facts) -> the ways there are -> your choice -> it''s begun -> what''s happening.","color":{"r":0.62,"g":0.45,"b":0.22,"a":1.0},"guid":"c80ce25b-80bc-49d5-a503-280ccfd5e735","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":0.0,"yMin":220.0,"xMax":1100.0,"yMax":380.0},"title":"How it ends","body":"The tide floats her, they row her off, or they push her into deep enough water: a notice says so and she takes up her course. If a try fails, or you leave her, she lies as she is (the crew try the oars now and then) and the choice comes again after a while. Running aground at all is rarer now: the charted course keeps to deep water where there''s a way (Course.cs: DeepWaterM, ShallowCost).","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"2cab0353-97fb-4bd1-91a9-0f2b2cf2a967","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}}'
